+/// Harness gate for the fallback publisher.
+///
+/// Local-model harnesses (buzz-agent, hermes-acp) may narrate a reply without
+/// running a publishing CLI command; richer harnesses (claude-agent-acp,
+/// goose, codex) publish reliably, and a fallback there would duplicate.
+fn fallback_publish_enabled(harness_name: &str) -> bool {
+    harness_name.contains("buzz-agent") || harness_name.contains("hermes")
